DESCRIPTION:Once a year\, India lights every lamp it owns. Diwali\, the Fe
 stival of Lights\, is a celebration of gathering\, feasting\, and joy. Thi
 s November\, that spirit comes to the winery tank room in partnership with
  Nalla at Cliff Lede Vineyards. Experience an evening where the layered fl
 avors of regional Indian cuisine meet the wines of Cliff Lede. Served on g
 olden thali beneath the glow of the tanks\, each course is thoughtfully pa
 ired. Shekar Sathyanarayana\, founder of Nalla\, Proprietor Jason Lede and
  Director of Winemaking Christopher Tynan will be your hosts for the eveni
 ng.
