X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.reusealliance.org/events/santarosa-repairfair", "Press Democrat": "https://www.reusealliance.org/events/santarosa-repairfair"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.reusealliance.org/events/santarosa-repairfair"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Repair Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T133000
UID:261021AN-OKvHLHU-50lPcRPORcg
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a lamp\, small appliance\, textile\, or bike in ne
 ed of repair?\n\n**Bring it to the Repair Fair!**‍ ‍\n\nVolunteers and
  specialized repair professionals will be on-hand to repair**\\*** your it
 ems.  We ask that you stay with your item while it's being fixed\, so yo
 u can learn tips for future maintenance\, how to shop for repairable goods
 \, and even how to repair things yourself!  \n\n**If you’d like to b
 ring an item to repair\, please register the item here**: https://www.reus
 ealliance.org/rf-reg (Pre-registering allows us to prepare for your item!)
 \n\nThis is a free public event.\n\n***\\*We cannot guarantee your item(s)
  will be repaired\, depending on the existing damage or breakage\, ability
  of volunteer fixers\, and availability of materials for repair. Note: we 
 cannot work on microwaves\, repair screens on cell phones/computer device
 s\, or perform any welding/brazing\, but we are happy to refer you to prof
 essionals who can. In addition\, the textile department is not able to per
 form the following:***\n\n***Replacing zippers***\n\n***Repairing shoes\, 
 leather\, or vinyl materials***\n\n***Performing alterations (making garme
 nts bigger/smaller)***\n\n***Replacing rivets/grommets***\n\n***Hemming ce
 rtain fabrics (stretchy fabric\, sleek/luxury fabrics e.g. prom dresses)**
 *\n\n***If you are in need of garment hemming\, we require that you please
  pin your garment to the desired length before you arrive.***\n\n**Join Us
 !**\n\nDo you enjoy fixing things?  Or want to help out in other ways?  
 We need you! **Sign up or email volunteer@reusealliance.org if you have a
 ny questions.**
LOCATION:Central Santa Rosa Library
URL:https://www.reusealliance.org/events/santarosa-repairfair
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
