SUMMARY:AI Reality Check Community Gathering
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T120000
UID:261111e_1acn93-Ua_ZGF5flu7aA
DESCRIPTION:AI Reality Check by Humans in Control\n\nDate and time: Saturd
 ay\, November 14 at 11:00 AM\n\nLocation: South Annex at The Key Room \\(G
 ilardi Training & Events Center\\) · Novato · CA\n\nJoin your neighbors 
 for an AI Reality Check\, part of a nationwide campaign about what AI mean
 s for our jobs\, our kids\, and our future.\n\nIn a short\, plain-language
  presentation\, we'll look at what AI really is\, the risks it creates\, a
 nd commonsense steps we can take to keep humans in control. Expect real au
 dience participation\, practical ways to take action\, and no jargon. You 
 don't need any AI expertise to join. Please register\, below!\n\nThis talk
  is hosted by Sophie DeWitt\, a Marin County–based program manager with 
 a background in education and advocacy. As a volunteer presenter\, she aim
 s to bring these conversations into the community and to make the future o
 f AI something we can all participate in shaping.\n\nLooking forward to se
 eing you there!\n\nRegistration: https://events.realitycheckhq.org/ai-real
 ity-check-31471bbe?utmsource=library&utmmedium=listing\n\nHumans in Contro
 l is a cross-partisan movement for commonsense AI rules.
LOCATION:The South Annex Room at the Gilardi Training and Events Center/Ke
 y Room
URL:https://events.realitycheckhq.org/ai-reality-check-31471bbe?utm_source
 =personal&utm_medium=listing
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
