DESCRIPTION:Due to an early harvest\, olive milling went from 0-100 overni
 ght! With milling is in full swing\, November’s 2nd Saturday\, the 14th 
 has been set for our annual Olio Nuovo Celebration and Luncheon here at th
 e mill! Olio nuovo is extra-virgin oil that’s been bottled just after mi
 lling. This is one of our favorite traditions—a chance to come together 
 and salute our obsession with recently-milled liquid green gold\, and gorg
 e yourselves on an oil-centric meal prepared by Chef Monica. Food tickets 
 are $35 but not required to attend and taste! We’ll also be doing regula
 r wine tastings
LOCATION:Terra Savia Winery & Olive Mill
