SUMMARY:Back Care Yoga Workshop ~ Live with Greater Ease
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T150000
UID:261113JrrG9y-sik-fyctfKR67zw
DESCRIPTION:Back Care Yoga Workshop — Move with Greater Ease\n\n"Your sp
 ine is your lifeline." — Denise Austin\n\nGive your back the attention i
 t deserves!\n\nAfter overcoming severe sciatica and finding lasting relief
 \, experienced yoga instructor MaryEllen Whitton created this workshop wit
 h a mission: to share the knowledge and techniques that made such a profou
 nd difference in her own life.\n\nThis workshop goes beyond the yoga mat! 
 Discover practical strategies\, simple movements\, and everyday habits to 
 improve spinal mobility\, release tension\, build strength\, and support a
  healthier back.\n\nLearn how small changes in the way you sit\, stand\, a
 nd move can make a meaningful difference in how you feel.\n\nAll levels we
 lcome. No yoga experience necessary.\n\nLeave with greater awareness and p
 ractical tools to care for your spine every day.
LOCATION:Revolution Yoga- Lewis Studio
URL:https://momence.com/Revolution-Yoga/Back-Care-for-Life/141898074?skipP
 review=true
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
