DESCRIPTION:Two Years of Songbird: Raise a Glass With Us! celebrates Songb
 ird Parlour's second anniversary in Jack London Village. Since opening\, t
 he restaurant has welcomed guests for special occasions\, memorable meals\
 , and everyday gatherings centered around good food\, wine\, and company. 
 Guests celebrating with Songbird on this special evening will receive a co
 mplimentary pour of sparkling wine as a thank you for two wonderful years.
  Whether returning as longtime guests or visiting for the first time\, eve
 ryone is invited to enjoy dinner\, raise a glass\, and celebrate the miles
 tone. Celebrate two years of Songbird Parlour and toast to many more memor
 able moments ahead! Reservations Recommended.
