DESCRIPTION:Canceled with plans to reschedule in 2027 Step into the world 
 of Charmian Kittredge London with author Marlo Faulkner as she presents he
 r book\,The Second Mrs. London. Set in San Francisco at the turn of the 20
 th century\, the novel tells the story of Charmian\, a bold and ambitious 
 woman whose life is forever changed when she meets young writer Jack Londo
 n. From a broken picnic date to a devoted partnership as friend\, confidan
 te\, editor\, and companion. Their story is one of passion\, resilience\, 
 an
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
