BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://kickwheelsonoma.com/products/2-part-clay-and-bloom-workshop-2-with-deanna-and-genna-sunday-november-15th-and-sunday-december-6th-10am-2pm-copy"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Clay + Bloom\, Ceramics\, Floral Design and Watercolor Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T140000
UID:261028c3eAwJ1lNEeSmSU5uPhBxQ
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to this second advent of our premiere multimedia works
 hop\, holiday edition! Two of our seasoned instructors are teaming up to b
 ring you an extra special collaboration.\n\nIn this event You’ll create 
 the base for your favorite floral arrangement centerpiece\, plus once this
  piece you’ve created has been fired we’ll all reconvene and create bo
 th a special floral arrangement specifically for this event and we’ll le
 arn how to paint a watercolor still life combing all of these elements int
 o a truly unique piece of Art!\n\nThis workshop meets twice\, our first me
 eting is Sunday November 15th 10am - 2pm where we host you for our clay pl
 ay and Sunday December 6th 10am - 2pm for our Centerpiece Floral arranging
  and Watercolor Still Life painting \n\nWe’ll cover Ceramic Slab Buildi
 ng techniques for our bases\, floral arranging and basic Watercolor techni
 ques for our still life. \n\nWe supply: \n\nClay\, Slab Templates\, Cera
 mic Tools\, We’ll provide the Glaze and Glazing once your vases have bee
 n bisque fired\, all flowers needed for arranging at the 2nd meeting of th
 is workshop\, Frog/Floral Structural Mechanics/Floral Tape for arrangement
 s\, watercolors for use day of\, Palettes\, Brushes\, Cups and Paper. \n\
 nYou will walk away from the workshop with a ceramic vase\, a beautiful fl
 oral arrangement and a watercolor still life that you yourself have fully 
 created! \n\nLunch provided for a small donation\, \\[please indicate die
 tary preferences beforehand if possible\\].
LOCATION:Kickwheel Sonoma Community Clay Center
