UID:261031LMw7_Oq8qUm8iu4i4gnBgA
DESCRIPTION:Come learn the basics of archery from safety to form in a fun\
 , outdoor environment. Our certified instructors will help you develop you
 r skills and confidence on the range. This basic class is appropriate for 
 beginners as well as those who haven't picked up the bow in a while. ***Ch
 ildren under 13 must attend with an adult.***\n\nTuition: $50\\* **Use Cod
 e: PACSUN10 to receive $10 off!** (not to be combined with any other offer
 )\n\n\\*When you become a Vilda Member\, you and a friend can attend all o
 ur year-round family classes for free! Memberships also make great gifts!!
  Learn more at https://www.vildanature.org/vilda-membership\n\nArchery Bas
 ics is part of Vilda\, which is dedicated to facilitating meaningful conne
 ctions with the natural world. Vilda started in Fairfax\, California in 20
 08 and has been running programs since then\, now serving over 2000 kids a
  year in Marin\, Sonoma\, and Tahoe. The organization is a 501c(3) non-pro
 fit led by founder Mia Andler\, offering nature education\, youth programs
 \, homeschool programs\, and summer camps in several Bay Area communities 
 and in Tahoe and Truckee. Vilda recently won the prestigious Pacific Sun 2
 026 Award for "Best Summer Camp"!
LOCATION:Stafford Lake Park
URL:https://vilda.squarespace.com/family-adult#archerynov15
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
