DESCRIPTION:The holidays are just around the corner\, and it’s time to g
 et festive! Join us at Jacuzzi for our annual Holiday Mercato\, featuring 
 seasonal products and gifts from Jacuzzi Family Vineyards and The Olive Pr
 ess alongside a curated collection of local artisans and makers.Shop art p
