X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Healdsburg Garden Club General Membership Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T150000
UID:261111fEB9riKqek6ShLDQvk4ftA
DESCRIPTION:The next General Membership meeting will take place on Monday\
 , November 16\, 2026\, at the Villa Chanticleer Annex (860 Chanticleer Way
 \, Healdsburg). The meeting begins at 1:00 PM\, followed by a light potluc
 k luncheon and an educational program. Guests are welcome.\n\nOur speaker 
 for November is Bruce Horace Robinson\, a Sonoma County Master Gardener\,
  Class of 2016. He will give a presentation on "Good Bugs\, Bad Bugs." 
 Bruce has been a gardener since childhood. After many years of changing g
 arden strategies\, he has become a strong believer in creating a garden t
 hat is in balance and harmony with nature by using biological controls an
 d adhering to sustainable gardening principles.\n\nThe public is invited 
 to attend this presentation starting at 2:00 PM at the Villa Chanticleer A
 nnex.
LOCATION:Villa Chanticleer Annex
URL:https://www.HealdsburgGardenClub.Org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
