 you value about Marin\, discuss challenges and priorities\, and help shape
  the County's future. Workshops are free and open to everyone\, with in-pe
 rson and online options available. Choose a date and location that works f
 or you! All events will have accessible services: ASL and Spanish interpre
 tation.
