BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.facebook.com/events/1602128350883194/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.facebook.com/events/1602128350883194/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.facebook.com/events/1602128350883194/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Rainbow Book Club: The Nightmare Before Kissmas by Sara Raasch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T180000
UID:261104AfODa7l4Nk6r3dVesFgkkw
DESCRIPTION:The Rainbow Book Club is cohosted by Mindy from Napa County Li
 brary and Napa Bookmine staff members Kass and Jules. The book club focuse
 s on books that explore and embrace queer identity. This is a free event\,
  but we appreciate your RSVP so we can plan for your attendance! We look f
 orward to welcoming you. ABOUT THE BOOK “Candy cane-coated catnip for th
 ose of us who grew up on Disney Channel Original Movies and wished they ma
 de them now for adults! Rollicking\, imaginative\, and sweetly steamy\, Th
 e Nightmare Before Kissmas transports readers to a holiday world you won
 ’t want to leave.” — Timothy Janovsky\, author of You’re a Mean On
 e\, Matthew Prince “Things get spicy\, quickly\, and this book is as del
 ightfully weird as it is funny\, fluffy\, and immersive in a fantasy world
  where problems revolve around hookups and the holidays\, not well\, you k
 now what we’re dealing with here on earth.” —Vulture “An irreveren
 t holiday fantasy that involves court politics\, young-adult growing pains
 \, and holiday cheer…equal parts silly and romantic.” —Booklist AN I
 NSTANT USA TODAY AND INDIE BESTSELLER! Red\, White & Royal Blue meets The 
 Nightmare Before Christmas in a sexy\, quirky rom-com where the golden-hea
 rted Prince of Christmas falls for the totally off-limits Prince of Hallow
 een. Nicholas “Coal” Claus used to love Christmas. Until his father\, 
 the reigning Santa\, turned the holiday into a PR façade. Coal will do an
 ything to escape the spectacle\, including getting tangled in a drunken\, 
 supremely hot make-out session with a beautiful man behind a seedy bar one
  night. But the heir to Christmas is soon commanded to do his duty: he wil
 l marry his best friend\, Iris\, the Easter Princess and his brother’s n
 ot-so-secret crush. A situation that has disaster written all over it. Thi
 ngs go from bad to worse when a rival arrives to challenge Coal for the pr
 incess’s hand…and Coal comes face-to-face with his mysterious behind-t
 he-bar hottie: Hex\, the Prince of Halloween. It’s a fake competition be
 tween two holiday princes who can’t keep their hands off each other over
  a marriage of convenience that no one wants. And it all leads to one of t
 he sweetest\, sexiest\, messiest\, most delightfully unforgettable love st
 ories of the year. ABOUT THE AUTHOR Sara Raasch is the New York Times and 
 USA Today bestselling author of the irreverently witty\, tantalizingly sex
 y adult romances\, The Entanglement of Rival Wizards\, Go Luck Yourself an
 d Nightmare Before Kissmas. Her books have been featured in the New York T
 imes\, People\, NPR\, Us Weekly\, Elle\, Vulture\, and more. She grew up a
 mong the cornfields of Ohio and currently lives in the historical corridor
  of southeastern Virginia.
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1602128350883194/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
