SUMMARY:Follow the Clucking Money: Petaluma's Forever Bills
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261118T203000
UID:2611117jAjno_rQ0mv4P4GK5yQTw
DESCRIPTION:When the chickens come home to roost\, who's paying for the co
 op?\n\nAt our first two workshops in the Follow the Clucking Money series\
 , we cracked open the expenditure and revenue sides of Petaluma's budget 
 — all those tricky questions about where the money comes from and the to
 ugh trade-offs we make in deciding where it goes.\n\nIn this workshop\, we
 ’re scratching beneath the surface of Petaluma’s long-term commitments
 \, including our roads that could use a little love. These promises keep i
 ncubating year after year\, and some of them are hatching!\n\nWhat does Pe
 taluma owe its future? And how do we pay the clucking bill?\n\nAt the work
 shop\, you'll get:\n\nA quick recap of workshops \\#1 and \\#2\, in case y
 ou missed them\n\nA first look at what we’ve learned about Petaluma’s 
 long term commitments\n\nA friendly\, no‑jargon walkthrough of a case st
 udy\n\nA chance to tell us what you want to explore next\n\nA sneak peek a
 t upgrades to our tools at followthecluckingmoney.org\n\nYour voice matter
 s. Your curiosity matters. And your participation can help shape what Peta
 luma if and how we choose to grow our revenues.\n\nCome learn\, laugh\, an
 d help steer the flock.\n\nNo experience with budgets required — just cu
 riosity and an appetite. Pizza will be served! 🍕\n\nDoors open at 6:45 
 pm!
LOCATION:Petaluma Community Center
URL:https://www.tickettailor.com/events/urbanchat/2502636
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108287732?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
