DESCRIPTION:The Petaluma Cinema Series is a unique educational forum that 
 invites community residents to join Santa Rosa Junior College students to 
 screen and discuss significant classic and modern cinema. The Rocky Horror
  Picture Show will be presented with the Bay Area’s premier live shadow 
 cast\, BL Rocky\, as well as stage props\, theatrical lighting\, and audie
 nce participation. Costumes are encouraged!. Visit the Petaluma Film Allia
 nce website for complete program details.
