DESCRIPTION:The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features artworks from six student
 s who participated in a seven-week art residency program.  The students se
 lected trash from Recology's Materials Recovery Facility and created art t
 hat inspires reflection on our habits with waste.  TRASH (The Recology Art
 start Student Hub) is a collaboration between Recology Sonoma Marin and Ar
 tstart.  This event is an SRJC Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonom
 a Marin and Artstart.  &#160\;For more information about the Herold Mahone
 y Library Gallery\, visit their website here. (https://libraries.santarosa
 .edu/mahoney_gallery)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260820T215728Z
LOCATION:Herold Mahoney Library Gallery - Petaluma Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23554-beautiful-trash-exhibit
