 hat You Make: Decorated Sugar Cookies\, Bars and Rugelach.\n\nWhat You Tak
 e: Recipes and a Sampler of Baked Goodies\n\nAbout the Instuctor: Chef Ma
 rco Soto is a Wine Country native with experience in fine dining\, family 
 restaurants and corporate catering. As an instructor for Sur La Table\, he
  shared his passion for seeing people  gain culinary confidence.\n\nReser
 vations close Nov. 19\, 2025 – Get Tickets Now!\n\n*\\*We are not able 
