SUMMARY:Disney's Frozen the Broadway Musical
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T122000
UID:261022NSAhPZN2_kygqh1K0O7BJA
DESCRIPTION:*Disney's Frozen The Broadway Musical* is based on the 2013 Di
 sney animated film\, focusing on the estranged relationship between royal 
 sisters Elsa and Anna. When Elsa loses control of her ice powers the kingd
 om is plunged into eternal winter\, Elsa flees\, and Anna embarks on a jou
 rney with Kristoff\, Sven\, and Olaf to find her sister and heal the kingd
 om.\n\nBook by Jennifer Lee\n\nMusic and Lyrics by Kristen Anderson-Lopez 
 and Robert Lopez\n\nDirected by Sarah Wintermeyer\n\nMusic and Vocal Direc
 tion by Gordon Pyle\n\nChoreography by Jolene Johnson
LOCATION:SRJC Burbank Auditorium
URL:https://srjc.universitytickets.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
