X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/pie-workshop/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Pie Workshop: Classic Apple & Pecan Pie for Thanksgiving
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T120000
UID:261111pFCQItHKuEWRIv5ZLwcwKA
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, November 21\, 2026 10:30 am to 12:00 pm\n\nLocation
 \n\nRoom 109\, Rotary Kitchen\n\nCategory\n\nCulinary Arts\n\nExperience L
 evel\n\nBeginning\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$100\n\
 nThanksgiving is days away\, and this workshop takes on the part most home
  bakers dread: the crust. Chef Maria Teresa Capdevielle\, a professionally
  trained pastry chef\, has you build two pies from scratch:\n\nDouble-Crus
 t Classic Apple Pie: flaky pastry\, cut and seasoned fruit\, and a properl
 y sealed\, vented and crimped top crust\n\nPecan Pie: a rich\, glossy clas
 sic with a filling that sets clean every time\n\nThe class covers keeping 
 dough cold\, blind baking\, avoiding a soggy bottom\, and how far ahead ea
 ch step can be done. Every student takes home pie dough\, ready to roll ou
 t for the holiday. All levels welcome\, beginners included.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/pie-workshop/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://3038.toastmastersclubs.org"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:You are Invited to North Bay Speech Masters Toastmasters Club Meet
 ing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T113000
UID:260903jIP2l3ZNpkOp0BYolkb9rg
DESCRIPTION:Whether it's improving our health\, focusing on professional a
 dvancement\, learning a new skill\, it is often helpful to obtain someone 
 to help learn new skills like speaking without preparation. The group at T
 oastmasters can help.\n\nWe call speaking without preparation\, impromptu 
 speaking. If you want to learn new Impromptu speaking skills\, Toastmaster
 s can help. During the meeting\, we will practice our impromptu speaking s
 kills during our session we call Table Topics. During the Table Topics\, t
 he speaker is given a question\, and they are asked to speak for 60 second
 s to 2 minutes about the question.\n\nOutside Toastmasters\, impromptu spe
 aking happens constantly. You might recognize it in moments such as:\n\n--
 Being asked for your opinion in a meeting\n\n--Responding to a follow-up q
 uestion during a presentation\n\n--Introducing yourself or someone else un
 expectedly\n\n--Handling a difficult or unplanned question\n\nYou can lear
 n tips and tricks about speaking off the cuff at our meeting. Won't you jo
 in us and learn\n\nwhat Toastmasters can do to help you on your profession
 al journey.\n\nFeel free to contact us for the zoon link at our website un
 der the "Contact Us" button. The website is https://3038.toastmastersclubs
 .org\n\nWe hold meetings online and in-person. If joining us in-person\, t
 here is limited parking in the front lot. Once in the front door\, please 
 sign in at the computer to obtain a visitors' badge. \\(IUsually\, there i
 s a sheet by the computer telling you how to log in for Toastmasters.\\) I
 f the sheet isn't there\, the clerk at the desk can help. Then take the el
 evator down to the second floor\, and take a left out of the elevator and 
 a left at the hall and come down to the meeting room.
LOCATION:Cogir of the North Bay
URL:https://3038.toastmastersclubs.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
