UID:261111LmOsBDuAkkqk0b9JyIdBZg
DESCRIPTION:Join local artist Irina Miller for a festive\, family-friendly
  workshop creating your own personalized holiday ornaments using acrylic p
 aint and mixed-media techniques.\n\nIrina will guide you step-by-step as y
 ou design and decorate 2–3 unique ornaments. Personalize them with names
 \, words\, messages\, or your own creative touches—perfect for hanging o
 n your tree or giving as handmade holiday gifts.\n\nNo painting experience
  is necessary\, and all materials are included.\n\nIn this workshop\, you 
 will:\n\n• Create 2–3 personalized holiday ornaments\n\n• Explore ac
 rylic painting and mixed-media techniques\n\n• Add names\, words\, or ot
 her personal details to your designs\n\n• Leave with handmade ornaments 
 ready for the holiday season\n\nDetails:\n\n• $45 per person\n\n• Ages
  7\\+\n\n• 2 hours\n\n• All materials included\n\n• No experience ne
 cessary\n\nImportant Notes:\n\n• Advance registration required • Works
 hops require a minimum of 4 participants • 72 hours notice required for 
 a partial refund • Workshop held outdoors under cover at Made Local Mark
 etplace in Montgomery Village
LOCATION:Made Local
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/personalized-holiday-ornament-wo
 rkshop-at-made-local/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
