X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Live Music at Spicy Vines by The Ramblers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T180000
UID:261106etFFuqo_jk6YhoAssDLhmA
DESCRIPTION:**Join us for live music in our tasting room! Reserve your spo
 t for this Saturday Live Music & Tasting Experience\, where exceptional wi
 nes\, laid-back vibes\, and great live music come together for an unforget
 table afternoon.**\n\n**Featured Band**\n\n**The Ramblers The Ramblers bri
 ng an unmistakable fusion of Americana\, classic rock ’n’ roll\, and r
 oots-inspired country to every performance. Their sound is rich with acous
 tic textures\, heartfelt harmonies\, and the kind of rhythm that draws lis
 teners in from the first note. Blending timeless influences with their own
  spirited flair\, Jason Uber and Dave McClary create a live experience tha
 t’s both intimate and electric — a true celebration of connection\, me
 lody\, and the joy of good music shared.**\n\n**Details**\n\n**Walk-ins ar
 e welcome\, but priority seating is given to wine club members and guests 
 with reservations. This event tends to fill up quickly\, so we highly reco
 mmend making a reservation to secure your table. No outside food is allowe
 d\, but we are dog and family friendly. For large groups of 13 or more\, p
 lease email us at visit@spicyvines.com.**
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/events/saturday-live-music-tasting/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
