X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Write Now! with Mark Sanford Gross
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T170000
UID:261112K7uh7EEWGUmAg2iFx2LRoA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for *Write Now!*\, a new writing group led by local wr
 iting coach Mark Sanford Gross. \n\n*Write Now!* is an in-the-moment prog
 ram for all folks who want to explore free writing\, story-telling\, and c
 uriosity about what happens when you get a notebook\, pen\, and a nudge. S
 hare the beauty of 'the spoken word' with others in this enthusiastic comm
 unity-building event through writing in a non-judgemental and trusting atm
 osphere. Bring friends and family.\n\nMark Sanford Gross has been building
  community through writing for the past few years along our coast.  He is
  the Creator and Co-Host of the local radio station's weekly program KGUA-
 Writers. He hosts writing workshops for local schools\, recovery programs 
 at Mendonoma Health Alliance\, and local pop-up destinations.
LOCATION:The Sea Ranch Lodge
URL:https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
