 ord Company\, Chuck Ragan \\(Hot Water Music\\)\, Lucero\, Tim Barry \\(Av
 ail\\) and more.\n\nIn addition to traveling the country \\(10\\+ cross-co
 untry tours\, SXSW x3\, Rockwood Music Hall NYC\, Hotel Cafe LA\, Off Beat
  Music Festival Reno\\)\, Travis Hayes has performed locally at The Fillmo
 re\, The Warfield\, The Mountain Winery\, Bimbo’s 365 Club\, Rickshaw St
 op\, The Chapel\, August Hall\, Sweetwater Music Hall and has headlined Gr
