SUMMARY:The Mad Hatter's Queen's Ball
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T230000
UID:2611116EU7sIPPaU-B_KgkGxiYoA
DESCRIPTION:Mad Hatter's Celebration Pre-Party - Eat\, drink\, and dance t
 he night away!\n\nThis extraordinary evening invites adults 30 and older t
 o dress to impress\, celebrate life\, and experience a night of fabulous h
 ats\, royal elegance\, delicious food\, dancing\, and a spectacular King a
 nd Queen Coronation!\n\nAnd who better to bring the excitement than the Qu
 een of the Airwaves herself — Queen EmCee Erika Blue of KZCT 89.5 FM OZC
 AT Radio. Dance the night away featuring David Martin\, the legendary foun
 der of OZCAT Radio\, spinning irresistible beats as our Royal DJ.\n\nGet r
 eady for a night of music\, laughter\, and dancing as Wonderland meets roy
 alty! ! And a Wonderland Feast of savory sliders\, fresh salads\, decadent
  desserts and a No-Host Bar fit for Royalty.\n\nBring your friends\, your 
 royal court\, and your imagination. Whether you're dressed as a kin queen\
 , or whimsical Wonderland character\, this is your invitation to step outs
 ide the ordinary!\n\nThis is a benefit for VCAT - Vallejo Community Access
  TV and the Mad Hatter Holiday Festival.\n\nADMISSION: $40 General | $60 V
 IP Queen’s Tables with special h'orderves and Queen's swag bag.\n\nGROUP
  TABLES: $350 for 8-10 guests.\n\nThe crown is waiting\, the music is call
 ing\, & wonderland awaits you!
