SUMMARY:Meet Me in St. Louis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T210000
UID:261112lx-vh42tgU6-qIMGvp9uNQ
DESCRIPTION:Meet Me in St. Louis is a heartwarming\, nostalgic musical tha
 t brings the charm and excitement of turn-of-the-century America to life. 
 Set in 1904 on the eve of the St. Louis World’s Fair\, the story follows
  the Smith family through a year of romance\, humor\, and unexpected chang
 e. At its center is the spirited and lovestruck Esther Smith\, whose bloss
 oming romance unfolds alongside her sisters’ own adventures and the fami
 ly’s hopes for the future. Featuring beloved songs like “The Trolley S
 ong\,” “Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\,” and “The Boy Nex
 t Door\,” this classic musical overflows with warmth\, wit\, and unforge
 ttable melodies. Rich with period detail\, lively ensemble numbers\, and t
 ender family moments\, Meet Me in St. Louis celebrates community\, resilie
 nce\, and the enduring power of home. Audiences will be swept up in its co
 lorful seasonal settings—from summer dances to a magical Christmas Eve
 —culminating in the dazzling anticipation of the World’s Fair. Perfect
  for theatregoers of all ages\, this timeless musical offers romance\, lau
 ghter\, and a joyful reminder that even in times of change\, love and fami
 ly light the way forward. MEET ME IN ST. LOUIS is presented by arrangement
  with Concord Theatricals on behalf of Tams-Witmark LLC. concordtheatrical
 s.com
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1599145155293030/1599145225293023/?act
 ive_tab=about
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.crushersofcomedy.com/november212026.html", "Press Democrat": "https://www.crushersofcomedy.com/november212026.html"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.crushersofcomedy.com/november212026.html"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Comedian Don Friesen
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T203000
UID:261112jg1MQdzEqkWb0z02OrMuXg
DESCRIPTION:The Laugh Cellar presents: \n\nLos Angeles-based Don Friesen 
 is an award-winning headliner comedian known for his high-energy\, physica
 l\, and sharply relatable comedy. The only two-time winner in the 50-year 
 history of the San Francisco Comedy Competition\, Friesen has appeared on 
 Showtime\, Netflix\, Amazon Prime\, Comedy Central\, Dry Bar Comedy\, and 
 SiriusXM. Friesen blends observational comedy\, storytelling\, improvisati
 on\, and physicality into a style all his own. His latest special\, Break 
 a Leg\, finds Friesen older\, possibly wiser\, and—spoiler alert—not q
 uite as married as he used to be. Whether navigating technology\, relation
 ships\, or the absurdities of everyday life\, Friesen has a knack for turn
 ing real-life chaos into big laughs.\n\nIndoor Event - Balletto Vineyards 
 Reserve Room\n\nTheater style seating\n\nWine by the bottle and savory sna
 cks available for purchase. \n\n21\\+ \n\nDoors 6:00 PM
LOCATION:Balletto Vineyards
URL:https://www.crushersofcomedy.com/november212026.html
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
