SUMMARY:Cozycats/Soul Mosaic at the Big Easy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T190000
UID:261104GX1QEZU-EEGfgwosJPt6iA
DESCRIPTION:Two bands\, one amazing night in Petaluma's best club.\n\nGet 
 ready for an evening of irresistible grooves\, global rhythms\, and seriou
 s soul!\n\nOpening the night\, SOUL MOSAIC brings its unique World Groove 
 sound to the stage\, blending original music with influences from African\
 , Caribbean\, Jazz\, Funk\, Latin\, and beyond. Featuring Rasaki Aladokun 
 of the King Sunny Adé Band on talking drum\, Soul Mosaic delivers a deep 
 rhythmic experience. Driving percussion\, intricate guitar work\, soulful 
 melodies\, and dynamic horn lines come together in a sound that will feed 
 your soul and move your body.\n\nThen keep the party going with Petaluma's
  own THE COZYCATS! Bringing a killer mix of classic favorites from Joss St
 one to Curtis Mayfield alongside a collection of fresh originals\, The Coz
 ycats have something for everyone. With a stage full of funkified horns\, 
 keyboards\, percussion\, and the smoking lead vocals of the one and only K
 ozue Ikusaki\, these cats keep the dancefloor jumping.
LOCATION:The Big Easy
URL:https://bigeasypetaluma.com/events/cozycats
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
