DESCRIPTION:Join us at our Community Milling Day and bring your olive harv
 est to be a part of something truly extraordinary! When our community memb
 ers contribute their olives\, we combine and mill them to craft a delightf
 ul extra virgin olive oil. The weight of your contribution directly influe
 nces the percentage of oil you'll receive once the milling process is comp
 lete.\n\nLet's make this Community Milling Day a collaborative success. Jo
 in us on October 25 or November 22 for a day of shared harvest and the cr
 eation of exceptional olive oil!
