DESCRIPTION:Singer-songwriter\, hug dealer and pioneer yoga musician\, Par
 is has toured the world playing 1\,500\\+ shows independently.\n\nBased in
  LA after living in Brazil\, South Africa and all over the US\, his feel-g
 ood music has grown into an “off the beaten path” fusion of folk-regga
 e-acoustic-electronic influences.\n\nIn addition\, Paris is the go-to sing
 er-songwriter paving the way for artists in the vibrant Yoga & Live Music 
 scene. He has played for over a thousand yoga classes alongside renowned t
 eachers and fellow musicians at festivals\, retreats and studios around th
 e globe.\n\nNo matter the venue\, Paris’ unmistakable\, feel-good music 
 uplifts\, connects\, and keeps the movement moving. More at kevinparismusi
 c.com
LOCATION:Yoga Community
