  lavender sprays and two lavender sugar scrubs. All materials are provided
 \, so just bring your creativity and get ready for a fun\, fragrant aftern
 oon! Additional sprays and scrubs will also be available for purchase.\n\n
 Additional sprays and scrubs will also be available for purchase.\n\nAll m
 aterials included.\n\nAbout MaryEllen: \n\nMaryEllen Whitton is an award-w
