BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/109106434?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Michelle Lambert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T160000
UID:261111S__JjnnO50yzKdYoBaYfew
DESCRIPTION:Join Michelle Lambert at Napa Yard for an outdoor concert at t
 he beautiful Oxbow Gardens. Bring a jacket and enjoy views of the River wh
 ile listening to the show. More info available here: https://www.napayard.
 com/\n\nBay Area breakout artist Michelle Lambert delivers a fun\, high-en
 ergy show filled with edgy\, heartfelt original music\, infectious pop hoo
 ks\, and unstoppable charisma. Fresh off a successful 40-date tour across 
 the Western states last year\, Michelle captivates audiences with soaring 
 vocals\, dynamic violin solos\, and vibrant energy that radiates through t
 he crowd. Her electrifying performances create an unforgettable live exper
 ience that will have you dancing\, smiling\, and celebrating all night lon
 g.\n\nRaised in Northern California and trained at the prestigious Berklee
  College of Music\, Michelle Lambert has forged her own path as a fearless
 \, independent pop artist. She has topped the charts of Indie Radio with h
 er original songs and was featured in the San Francisco Giants’ City Con
 nect Campaign as a notable Bay Area artist. Michelle cut her teeth perform
 ing and writing in the competitive music scenes of Nashville and Los Angel
 es before returning to the Bay Area to tour with her own thriving career. 
 Known for her powerful vocals\, masterful violin playing\, and bold\, colo
 rful costumes\, Michelle pairs striking visuals with raw emotional storyte
 lling—embodying creativity\, resilience\, and the adventure of chasing y
 our dreams. For more info on Michelle visit: https://www.michellelambert.c
 om
LOCATION:Napa Yard Oxbow
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/109106434?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Newcomer Meeting in Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T170000
UID:260212ifyKFjYl5EOFR6Bklp_zmw
DESCRIPTION:**Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.**\n\nOvereater
 s Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support each other in recov
 ering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you feel you have a pr
 oblem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your background\, belie
 fs\, or eating habits.\n\nWe hold an in-person newcomer meeting on **Sunda
 ys from 4:00 – 5:00 PM** **at Christ Church United Methodist\, 1717 Yulu
 pa Ave.\, Room #4\, Santa Rosa**. Contact: Abigail (707) 293-5888. You may
  view all North Bay OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northb
 ayoa.org/meetings.html .\n\nIn OA\, members experience **spiritual\, emoti
 onal\, and physical recovery** by practicing the **Twelve Steps** and livi
 ng by their spiritual principles—one day at a time.\n\nOA is **not** a d
 iet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembers have different plans of e
 ating.\n\nOA does **not** endorse any specific food plan.\n\nIf food is ca
 using problems in your life\, you don’t have to struggle alone. Recovery
  is possible\, and help is available.\n\n**Visit:** https://www.northbayoa
 .org/\n\n**Find a meeting:** https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Christ Church United Methodist
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
