SUMMARY:Senior Stroll: Las Gallinas Birds
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T120000
UID:260915xO9kMEfBy0WBQ5cqJloDfw
DESCRIPTION:Directions: Meet at the Las Gallinas Sanitary District water t
 reatment ponds in San Rafael \\(310 Smith Ranch Road\\). From Hwy 101 in S
 an Rafael\, take the exit for Smith Ranch Rd east approximately 0.7 miles.
  Drive over the railroad tracks and immediately turn left to stay on Smith
  Ranch Rd. \\(If you go through the park entrance\, you have gone too far\
 \). Follow Smith Ranch Rd 0.8 miles to treatment facility. Park on the lef
 t.\n\nSponsor: Parks\n\nAccommodation Information: If you are a person wit
 h a disability and require an accommodation to participate in a County pro
 gram\, service\, or activity\, requests may be made by calling&n bsp\;415-
 473-4381 \\(Voice\\)\, Dial 711 for CA Relay\, or by submitting a\n\nDisab
 ility Accommodation Request\n\nat least five business days in advance of t
 he event. We will do our best to fulfill requests received with less than 
 five business days' notice. Copies of documents are available in alternati
 ve formats upon request.\n\nThe ponds at the Las Gallinas water treatment 
 facility are a fabulous place to get close looks at a variety of waterfowl
 \, plus there are usually plenty of hawks hunting for rodents and other pr
 ey in the surrounding fields. Remember to bring binoculars if you have the
 m. No pets are allowed\, except for service/companion animals. Adverse wea
 ther or poor air quality may cancel. Registration is required.\n\nQue stio
 ns: Contact\n\nshannon.burke%40marincounty.gov\n\nShannon Burke
LOCATION:Las Gallinas Treatment Ponds
URL:https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://napavalleymuseum.org/blogs/upcoming-exhibitions/eames-eames"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:EAMES & EAMES: Meet the couple who Defined Modern Design
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T170000
UID:261004b3N3TTb9xEOYmqLuW6afqw
DESCRIPTION:EAMES & EAMES: Meet the couple who Defined Modern Design\n\nCr
 eated in collaboration with the Eames Institute of Infinite Curiosity.\n\n
 EAMES & EAMES explores the iterative\, hands-on\, and human-centered appr
 oach of Charles & Ray Eames. Through furniture\, toys\, paintings\, graphi
 cs\, and personal belongings collected over their lifetimes\, this groundb
 reaking exhibition looks beyond the iconic Eames chairs to reveal the brea
 dth of their creative practice. More than any single object\, their work o
 pened doors to new and unexpected ways of seeing\, thinking\, making\, and
  understanding the world—ideas that continue to inspire us today.\n\nCur
 ated by Llisa Demetrios\, Co-Founder & The Lucia Eames Chief Curator of th
 e Eames Institute of Infinite Curiosity.
LOCATION:The MAC - Napa Valley Museum of Art & Culture
URL:https://napavalleymuseum.org/blogs/upcoming-exhibitions/eames-eames
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
