 tudio\n\nCategory\n\nCeramics\, Extended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\nIn
 termediate\n\nAges\n\n17\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials Fee
 :\n\n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nThis session is for those 
