DESCRIPTION:Four veteran songwriters trade songs and stories. If you've he
 ard one or more of them before\, you know it's going to be a fun time. If 
 you haven't\, you're in for a treat. Visit their websites and learn more!!
  \n\n\\*\\*AL HAAS\, a guitarist and writer\, plays house concerts up and 
 down the west coast. His website: alhaas.bandcamp.com \n\n\\*\\*DAVE BROUI
 LLETTE splits his time between Petaluma and Newburyport Massachusetts\, pe
 rforms solo and with several bands including Dirty Red Barn. \n\n\\*\\*CYN
 THIA BRANDO is an LA based singer and writer who tours nationally. Her web
 site: cynthiabrando.com.\n\n \\*\\* JOHN ROY ZAT is a Bay Area fiddler\, g
 uitar picker and singer. His song "Midnight On The Water" has been recorde
 d by Kate Wolf and others. His website: royzat.com\n\nFACEBOOK EVENT PAGE:
  https://www.facebook.com/events/2566631333858348/\n\nFREE!!
