SUMMARY:Sistah 2 Sistah
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261124T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261124T170000
DTSTAMP:20260924T125148Z
UID:20261118T000000Z-24059@calendar.santarosa.edu__20261124
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,322,322/730_sistah_2_sistah.rev.1790278878.png
CATEGORIES:Department Events
DESCRIPTION:Check the SRJC Sawubona BLOC website for any event changes. (h
 ttps://bloc.santarosa.edu/august-2026)  Sistah 2 Sistah is a welcoming spa
 ce for Black girls and young women to connect\, uplift\, and empower one a
 nother.  Through sisterhood\, conversation\, wellness\, education\, leader
 ship\, and creative experiences\, students can build meaningful relationsh
 ips while growing personally and academically.  Topics and activities may 
 include:Sisterhood &amp\; community  Self-love and confidence  Academic &a
 mp\; career success  Wellness and life skills  Leadership and personal gro
 wth  Cultural identity and self-discovery    The Sawubona BLOC is located 
 in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa Campu
