 -2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check the SRJC Sawubona BLOC website
  for any event changes.</a></p><p>  Sistah 2 Sistah is a welcoming space f
 or Black girls and young women to connect\, uplift\, and empower one anoth
 er.</p><p>  Through sisterhood\, conversation\, wellness\, education\, lea
 dership\, and creative experiences\, students can build meaningful relatio
 nships while growing personally and academically.</p><p>  Topics and activ
 ities may include:</p><ul><li>Sisterhood &amp\; community  </li><li>Self-l
 ove and confidence  </li><li>Academic &amp\; career success  </li><li>Well
 ness and life skills  </li><li>Leadership and personal growth  </li><li>Cu
 ltural identity and self-discovery  </li></ul><p>  The Sawubona BLOC is lo
 cated in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa
  Campus.</p>
