 rience snowfall in wine country Watch Santa light the Wine Barrel Tree Str
 oll through a festive Winter Market \\+ Vintage Lighted Holiday Cars! Sip 
 wine and enjoy delicious food Celebrate with live music ✨ Bring the litt
 le ones for holiday fun in the Kids Zone This year’s celebration is extr
 a special as St. Helena and Beringer Vineyards both celebrate 150 years! C
 ome celebrate Napa Valley history\, community\, and holiday tradition at N
 apa Valley’s biggest tree lighting celebration. One iconic town. One ico
 nic winery. 150 years. One magical night. St. Helena\, the Napa Valley Ori
 ginal. ✨ ✨ EVENING SCHEDULE | 5–7 PM 5:00 PM — Winter Market Opens
 \, Lighted Vintage Cars\, Shop\, sip\, eat & enjoy holiday festivities 5:0
 0 PM — Live Music by Vybe Society on the XXXTBD Stage Begins  We are wor
 king on a sponsor for this that should be mentioned\\). 6:00 PM — Openin
 g Ceremony with the Mayor 6:10 PM — Santa Arrives!  The countdown begins
  as the SH Fire Department and Santa light \\+ the spectacular 38-foot Ber
 inger Holiday Wine Barrel Tree — followed by magical snowfall in St. Hel
 ena! ❄️✨ 7:00 PM — Event Concludes ✨ Presenting Sponsors: Visit 
 St. Helena \\+ St. Helena Chamber of Commerce Beringer Vineyards City of S
 t. Helena
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1430277949214608/
