SUMMARY:Thanksgiving at Konocti Vista Casino
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T210000
UID:261113a0hho3Hp40ywONgyq0fH7A
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Thanksgiving at Valentino’s Restaurant!  This Than
 ksgiving\, let Valentino’s Restaurant at Konocti Vista Casino take care 
 of the cooking! Whether you're gathering with family and friends at home o
 r joining us for a traditional holiday dinner\, we've got something delici
 ous planned for you. Thanksgiving Dinner | November 26 Thursday | 2 PM –
  8 PM Join us at Valentino’s Restaurant for a traditional Thanksgiving d
 inner featuring: • Sliced Turkey • Mashed Potatoes & Gravy • Dinner 
 Salad • Cranberry Sauce • Dinner Roll & Butter • Green Beans • Pum
 pkin Pie Adults: $22 | Children 10 & Under: $11 No reservations required! 
 Available while supplies last. No substitutions. NEW THIS YEAR! Thanksgivi
 ng To-Go Catering We do the cooking. You give the thanks! Spend less time 
 in the kitchen and more time making memories with your loved ones. Valenti
 no’s is now offering Thanksgiving To-Go Catering\, featuring your favori
 te holiday dishes prepared fresh and ready to serve! Build your own Thanks
 giving feast with our convenient à la carte menu: • Sliced Turkey \\(Wh
 ite & Dark Meat\\) – $34 for 2 lbs. • Smashed Yukon Gold Potatoes – 
 $8 per quart • Turkey Gravy – $8 per quart • Sautéed Green Beans wi
 th Bacon – $15 for 2 lbs. • Cranberry Sauce – $12 for 2 cups • Amb
 rosia Salad – $15 per quart • Dinner Rolls & Butter – $12 for 6 roll
 s • Apple Pie – $30 • Pumpkin Pie – $25 Everything is prepared and
  ready to serve\, with no additional cooking needed! How to Order Thanksgi
 ving To-Go Order Deadline: Friday\, November 20\, 2026 To reserve your Tha
 nksgiving feast\, visit Valentino’s Restaurant to request a Thanksgiving
  To-Go Order Form or call 707-262-3241 for more information. Minimum quant
 ities apply to select menu items. Advance orders are required. Visit Valen
 tino’s Restaurant Konocti Vista Casino 2755 Mission Rancheria Road\, Lak
 eport\, CA 95453 Restaurant: 707-262-3247 Make this Thanksgiving one to re
 member with great food\, family\, and friends at Lake County's voted Best 
 Casino!
LOCATION:Konocti Vista Casino Resort
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1123775380009001/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
