 alented rhythm guitarist and vocalist with an extensive repertoire of cove
 rs from the 60's\, 70's\, 80's\, 90's and beyond\, and is also a popular s
 inger/songwriter.\n\n"Randy's Ear Candy " is his weekly radio show streami
 ng on KSVY.org\, and live at 91.3 FM\, Saturdays 5:00p-7:00p\, with rock n
 ' roll deep cuts\, reggae\, and jam bands.\n\nRandy has been hosting Open 
