  more\, you'll find unique\, handcrafted gifts and holiday goodies for eve
 ryone on your list.\n\nSip on your favorite DG wines while you shop\, supp
 ort local businesses\, and kick off the holiday season with us. Good wine\
 , great gifts\, and a little holiday cheer—what more could you ask for?\
