BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/a-very-merry-weekend-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:A Very Merry Weekend
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T180000
UID:26111024_SYxKpv0aIO69Ug6Zviw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for A Very Merry Weekend at Montgomery Village!\n\nCel
 ebrate the season with a weekend of exclusive retail offerings\, family-fr
 iendly entertainment\, festive trimmings at every turn\, and more.\n\nFrid
 ay\, November 27:\n\nLive holiday music from 12pm-2pm in The Courtyard\, c
 ourtesy of Jimmy Galvan.\n\nHoliday caroling from 3:30pm to 5:30pm across 
 property\, courtesy of Silver Belles Caroling Group.\n\nSaturday\, Novembe
 r 28:\n\nWeekend Santa Sightings begin! Photos with Santa take place in Th
 e Courtyard on weekends from Saturday\, November 28 to Sunday\, December 2
 0\, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. daily. Appointments are highly recommended. A portio
 n of proceeds from Weekend Santa Sightings benefit Sonoma County Secret Sa
 nta Program. Book your spot here.\n\nCelebrate Small Business Saturday by 
 supporting local small businesses across the Village.\n\nCelebrate the sea
 son at our Second Annual Tree Lighting Celebration on Saturday\, November 
 28\, from 5–7 p.m. in The Courtyard!\n\nEnjoy a festive evening filled w
 ith holiday music\, creative activities\, and a special appearance by Sant
 a and Mrs. Claus. Admission is free\, with seasonal fun for the whole fami
 ly:\n\nLive holiday music and carolers\, plus a family-friendly holiday si
 ngalong at 6:45 p.m.\n\n\\- Complimentary hot cocoa\n\n\\- Churros and coo
 kies available for purchase\n\n\\- Complimentary caricature portraits\n\n\
 \- Custom wood-burned gift tags\n\n\\- Make-your-own mini snowmen and jing
 le bell wreath ornaments\n\n\\- Write your letters to Santa\, delivered th
 rough the official Montgomery Village Santa Mail mailbox\n\n\\- A special 
 visit from Santa and Mrs. Claus\n\n\\- Make the evening a little sweeter w
 ith a stop at Salt & Straw. During the event\, enjoy a complimentary scoop
  with the purchase of a scoop\, available November 28\, 2026\, from 5–7 
 p.m.\n\nSunday\, November 29:\n\nLive holiday music in The Courtyard\n\nAB
 OUT SONOMA COUNTY SECRET SANTA\n\nSonoma County’s Secret Santa is a nonp
 rofit gift-giving program\, providing gifts and holiday cheer to those les
 s fortunate in our community.\n\nSecret Santa has been bringing joy to peo
 ple throughout Sonoma County for over 30 years\, ensuring that children\, 
 teens\, adults\, and seniors who would not otherwise receive a holiday gif
 t have reason to celebrate and experience the compassion and generosity of
  their community.
LOCATION:Montgomery Village - Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/a-very-merry-weekend-2/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
