DESCRIPTION:Wednesdays Weekly · 8 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nOctober 7 – D
 ecember 2\, 2026\n\n10:00 AM – 1:00 PM\n\nExceptions\n\nNo class Novembe
 r 11\, Veterans Day\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramics Studio\n\nCategory\
 n\nCeramics\, Extended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\nAdvanced\n\nAges\n\n
 17\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$30\n\nTotal Regi
 stration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nThis session is designed for people who have alr
 eady taken multiple wheel throwing courses. A continuation of our intermed
 iate course\, this upper level / advanced course will help you hone your t
 hrowing skills through more complex demos\, and nuanced approaches to tech
 nical throwing. In this 8 week course\, students will dive deep into devel
 oping their own unique voice as they build a technical toolset for the ind
 ependent maker. In addition to throwing\, surface decoration techniques wi
 ll be explored as well as the opportunity to experiment with different cla
 y bodies.With your 8 week class registration\, students receive the opport
 unity to purchase a studio pass for ½ off during the duration of their cl
 ass. Sign ups for membership will be included
