DESCRIPTION:Discover the Art. Savor the Flavor. Find Something Special. AR
 TNITE Healdsburg is a new community event celebrating art and creativity w
 ith over 20 galleries participating. DISCOVER THE ART Visit our downtown g
 alleries and collect your stamp. SAVOR THE FLAVOR Show your "artnite" pass
 port at participating restaurants and wineries for a free treat\, pour or 
 special perk. FIND SOMETHING SPECIAL Shop the boutiques and retail stores 
 along the way! Surprises await - shops may offer treats\, delights\, or a 
 bit of magic!  WWW.ARTNITEHEALDSBURG.COM Find the gallery map and a list o
 f participating restaurants and wineries online. Pick up your ARTNITE pass
 port available at any downtown gallery\, and start your journey anywhere! 
 \\#artnitehealdsburg From 5pm - 7pm every 1st Thursday of the month Thank 
 you to @stayhealsburg and @healdsburgchamber for sponsoring our event thro
 ugh their District Development Program. With the support of the hotel part
 ners in Healdsburg\, these annual sponsorships fund events that enhance th
 e visitor experience when enjoying our wonderful town. To book your stay f
 or this event\, visit www.stayhealdsburg.com.
