SUMMARY:A Candlelight Christmas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T213000
UID:261011VxZoytwuH06jsPpF620A7w
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join Cantiamo Sonoma for a cherished holiday 
 tradition: A Candlelight  Christmas\, an evening of exquisite a cappella
  music spanning the Renaissance to contemporary composers.\n\nThis year’
 s celebration is especially meaningful as Cantiamo presents a new commissi
 on\, The Lamb\, by acclaimed Norwegian composer and pianist Ola Gjeilo. 
 We are thrilled to share this beautiful new work with you and to celebrate
  the continuing tradition of bringing extraordinary choral music to our co
 mmunity.\n\nFollowing the concert\, please join us for a festive champagne
  reception\, where we can gather\, celebrate the season\, and share our a
 ppreciation for the music and community that make Cantiamo so special.
LOCATION:St. Seraphim Of Sarov Orthodox Church
URL:https://cantiamosonoma.org/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
