DESCRIPTION:Benny Bassett rolls into Napa for another amazing night at JaM
  Cellars! Come out to see Benny Bassett perform live as part of his 17 Sta
 te tour taking him across the United States for performances that will lea
 ve you with some great memories! \n\nBassett's musical style can be descri
 bed as a fusion of alternative rock\, folk\, and singer-songwriter influen
 ces. Through his captivating performances\, he creates an intimate atmosph
 ere that allows the focus to be on the profound lyrics and the powerful em
 otions they evoke. Benny has played over 1\,100 shows in seven countries a
 nd 47 U.S. States. He has driven over 600\,000 miles and is primed for ano
 ther season of performances across the United States in the Summer of 2026
 .
