SUMMARY: How to Draw People\, Places and Things
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Ann Marie Torrez\nOn-going\, Thursdays\n2:00PM-4:
 00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$35.00 Per Class\n\nJoin Ann Torrez and
  learn a few different ways to achieve instant gratification quickly in y
 our drawings and get to the fun part of creating!\n\nAnn will introduce y
 ou to a variety of drawing materials and teach you how to use them. You c
 an also expect to explore a variety of different papers\, and materials t
 hat will aid in transferring your sketch to a more refined\, complete pie
 ce of artwork.\n\nYou can expect a mix of practical tips\, upbeat encoura
 gement and a little entertainment that will help you break through mental
  barriers and hesitations!\n\n\nTo register\, please email Ann at: annde_
