DESCRIPTION:Please join us on the first Friday of every month at Convene T
 asting Lounge from 5-7pm for Caviar and a glass of Convene by Dan Kosta 
 Chardonnay or Pinot Noir.\n\nEnjoy life’s pleasures that combine great w
 ines\, lite bites\, and a moment to unwind. A French tradition that Dan ha
 s embraced since his early restaurant years. Indulge in Convene wines pair
 ed with world-renowned producer Tsar Nicoulai Caviar.\n\nCAVIAR MENU\n\n~
 OSETRA~\n\nAccoutrements include potato chips and Bellwether Farms creme f
