BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.voena.org/concerts/2026/12/04/mare-island-light-night"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:VOENA Light Night Holiday Tree Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T190000
UID:260905NOOy-S_pRUGYpQ1IH9sbHA
DESCRIPTION:Join us at 5 p.m. for Mare Island's annual Light Night Holiday
  Tree Lighting Celebration\, a magical evening that brings the community t
 ogether to welcome the holiday season. This free\, family-friendly celebra
 tion features hot cocoa\, delicious cookies by Brioche de Paris\, and the 
 excitement of gathering together as the magnificent holiday tree comes to 
 life. \\(Tree lighting will take place after 5:30 p.m. and before 6:00 p.m
 .\\) VOENA returns for another year to fill Mare Island with the joyful so
 und of children's voices! Dressed in nostalgic wool coats and festive red 
 scarves\, VOENA's young singers will bring warmth and holiday magic to the
  celebration with beloved Christmas favorites and familiar songs you'll wa
 nt to sing along to\, creating a festive musical experience for the whole 
 family. VOENA's mission is "Uniting the World with Children's Voices." Rep
 resenting more than 35 cultures\, VOENA's young singers share a message of
  unity\, peace\, and connection through music. Their voices have been hear
 d on some of the world's most celebrated stages\, including the White Hous
 e\, Carnegie Hall\, the London Olympic Games\, and the World Expo in Japan
 . Come celebrate the season with VOENA\, Mare Island\, and our community a
 s music\, lights\, and holiday spirit come together for a beautiful evenin
 g of joy\, connection\, and peace. REMINDER: Receive a complimentary cockt
 ail or mocktail by bringing a new or gently used coat or sleeping bag for 
 Vallejo Together. Beverages will be available inside Redwood Empire Distil
 lery. Layer up! The temperatures will be in the mid-50s. PARKING: Please p
 ark in Lots C and D.
LOCATION:Mare Island
URL:https://www.voena.org/concerts/2026/12/04/mare-island-light-night
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
