X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://www.gatherpetaluma.org", "Press Democrat": "http://www.gatherpetaluma.org"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://www.gatherpetaluma.org"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Spencer LaJoye at Gather Petaluma - a Free\, Community Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T210000
UID:261109cYYSVXSixkifvsH6NkbQIQ
DESCRIPTION:Music for everyone: Our first concert is free!\n\nFree tickets
  required. Reserve yours at www.gatherpetaluma.org\n\nJoin us on December 
 4th as Spencer LaJoye takes the stage for Gather Petaluma’s first-ever c
 oncert - free and open to all!\n\nMeet Spencer: Spencer LaJoye makes queer
  indie folk music for all. A coast-to-coast singer-songwriter and vocal lo
 op artist with Midwest roots\, Spencer is a classically trained violinist 
 with a theater kid’s heart and a theology degree. They won the 2021 Kerr
 ville Songwriting Competition and the 2024 Songwriter Serenade\, and their
  viral anthem “Plowshare Prayer” found a home in hearts around the wor
 ld. Charming and full of banter\, Spencer will have you laughing one momen
 t and weeping the next.\n\nFriday\, December 4 · Doors 6:30 p.m. · Music
  7:00 p.m.\n\nInside the Sanctuary at Gather Petaluma\, 825 Middlefield Dr
 .\, Petaluma\n\nReserve your free ticket at www.gatherpetaluma.org\n\nWant
  to make the night extra special? Join our intimate pre-show reception wit
 h Spencer\, limited to just 12 guests. Your $100 ticket includes light ref
 reshments\, a song performed only for reception guests and helps keep the 
 concert free for all. \\(Add it at checkout\\)\n\nFree tickets required. R
 eserve yours at www.gatherpetaluma.org
LOCATION:Gather Petaluma
URL:http://www.gatherpetaluma.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
