SUMMARY:Crossing Delancey - a Curtain Call Theatre Production
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T213000
UID:261108JX9OuX1fKE2wLjXP2f_VAg
DESCRIPTION:She knows exactly the kind of guy she wants\, but grandmother 
 Bubbe and the matchmaker think differently. \n\nThis nostalgic favorite w
 as made into a beloved film in 1988. It is a love story about Izzy\, a tho
 roughly modern woman with not the greatest taste in men. Her grandmother B
 ubbe is desperate to get her married. Enter Henka\, the matchmaker with a 
 New York accent so sharp it could cut cheese\, and Sam Posner\, the pickle
  man with the heart of a poet. Will Izzy make the right choice? Doors open
  half an hour early for a photographic slideshow about New York’s Lower 
 East Side\, and some special snacks: Babka and Brooklyn Egg Creams. Don’
 t miss this delightful romantic comedy suitable for ages 8 and up. \n\nPl
 aywright: Susan Sandler\n\nDirector: Amanda Claiborne\n\nStarring: Kathy P
 ing-Rogers\, Kimy Martinez-Knight\, Nick Stewart\, Karen Clancy and Jake H
 amlin\n\n**Trigger warnings:** Mention of suicide and some mild cursing in
  Yiddish. Suitable for ages 8 and up.
LOCATION:Curtain Call Theatre Russian River Hall
URL:https://www.russianriverhall.com/shop/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.starmansf.com/events/a-night-of-bowie-at-the-mystic-theatre-special-guest-vocalist-randy-cordeiro", "Press Democrat": "https://www.starmansf.com/events/a-night-of-bowie-at-the-mystic-theatre-special-guest-vocalist-randy-cordeiro"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.starmansf.com/events/a-night-of-bowie-at-the-mystic-theatre-special-guest-vocalist-randy-cordeiro"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Starman SF - A Night of Bowie at the Mystic Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T223000
UID:261105NCHw2p7btU2LXs5lAvacYA
DESCRIPTION:Experience the music\, energy\, and theatrical magic of David 
 Bowie as Starman SF welcomes special guest vocalist Randy Cordeiro to the 
 Mystic Theatre on Friday\, December 4.\n\nAn immersive\, authentic concert
  experience\, Starman SF transports you into the world of a David Bowie sh
 ow—celebrating the songs\, sound\, and spirit of one of music’s most e
 xtraordinary artists.\n\nRandy brings extensive experience as a solo artis
 t and frontman\, with remarkable vocal range and a striking ability to cap
 ture the distinctive tone\, phrasing\, and emotion of Bowie’s voice acro
 ss his many musical eras. Paired with Starman SF’s immersive live perfor
 mance\, the effect is transporting—at moments\, you could close your eye
 s and swear you were listening to Bowie himself.\n\nThis is a rare opportu
 nity to experience Randy Cordeiro in a different musical light—and a spe
 cial pre-holiday treat for anyone who loves David Bowie.\n\nJoin us for a 
 night of sound and vision. Let’s dance!\n\n Mystic Theatre • Petaluma
   \n\nFriday\, December 4\, 2026  \n\nDoors: 7:30PM | Show: 8:30PM\n\n 
 Tickets are on sale now!\n\nhttps://www.eventim.us/event/starman-sf/708964
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://www.starmansf.com/events/a-night-of-bowie-at-the-mystic-theatr
 e-special-guest-vocalist-randy-cordeiro
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
