 zmer beats and arresting Yiddish refrains. The acclaimed ensemble is a mus
 ical feast that explodes into a global food-fight of Jazz\, Latin\, Rock\,
  and Folk. In response to the poetry and folk music of Judaic roots\, thei
 r original voice resounds with themes of social justice\, human dignity\, 
 and mutual understanding. Led by front man Leeav Sofer\, one of Jewish Jou
 rna
