DESCRIPTION:Appellation Healdsburg hosts its first Holiday Artisan Market 
 over one December weekend\, bringing together a hand-selected group of art
 ists\, makers\, independent designers and specialty food producers from So
 noma County and beyond. Shop artisan jewelry and accessories\, natural bea
 uty products\, homewares\, apparel\, art\, printed goods and gourmet treat
 s\, and meet the people behind the work. The market kicks off the holiday 
 season at Appellation Healdsburg alongside the hotel's holiday tree lighti
 ng and seasonal programming. Curated by Darcy Russell of Feria Urbana.
