BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/weekend-santa-sightings/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Weekend Santa Sightings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T150000
UID:261110M5mC5XFlWUWTP6_Nt1WjhA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holidays and join us at the Village for photos w
 ith Santa happening on weekends from Saturday\, November 28th to Sunday\, 
 December 20th\, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. daily.\n\nAppointments are highly recomm
 ended\, as we cannot guarantee that we can accommodate all walk-ups throug
 hout the event series. Reserve your 5-minute window now for a $35 fee duri
 ng our initial release (through Friday\, November 13). Beginning Saturday\
 , November 14\, the fee increases to $45. Each family will receive a print
  to take home that day\, as well as a digital copy of their photo followin
 g the appointment. Please note that we do not call or text waitlisted gues
 ts.\\*\n\nMake the most of your Santa visit:\n\nYour photo package include
 s up to five digital photos\, emailed the Monday following your appointmen
 t\, plus a print to take home that day.\n\nEnjoy writing letters to Santa 
 and dropping them off at the official Montgomery Village Santa Mail mailbo
 x\, plus crafts at our holiday craft tables.\n\nSweeten your visit! Stop b
 y Salt & Straw before or after your appointment and enjoy a complimentary 
 kids’ scoop with any ice cream purchase during Weekend Santa Sightings (
 valid each Saturday and Sunday from 11/28/26 to 12/20/26 between 11 a.m. t
 o 3 p.m.).\n\nKeep an eye out for ME SPA’s elves\, spreading holiday che
 er and a little stress relief with special cards to redeem at the spa. Bri
 ng yours in for a Chill Bag\, a holiday survival kit filled with goodies a
 nd coupons to help you keep your cool all season long. For an extra moment
  of relaxation\, enjoy a complimentary chair massage as scheduling allows.
 \n\nRetro Foto will be assisting in making this memory last a lifetime by 
 providing Santa with a vintage ride for all to enjoy! Retro Foto is Sonoma
  County’s boutique photo booth experience. Lola is a fully restored 1970
  Volkswagen bus that loves the camera – whether it’s as a photo booth 
 or a photo backdrop! Lola is all about making memories\, which is why Sant
 a thought this would be the perfect way to drive into the Holiday season!\
 n\nBy attending this event\, guests consent to appear in photo/video recor
 dings that may be used for website photography or other purposes.\n\n\\*A 
 portion of proceeds will benefit Sonoma County Secret Santa Program.
LOCATION:Montgomery Village - Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/weekend-santa-sightings/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
