DESCRIPTION:**2026 Marin Ballet Nutcracker**\n\nThe **Marin Ballet Nutcrac
 ker** is a beloved holiday tradition that brings the magic of the season t
 o life. Our talented dancers perform to Tchaikovsky’s iconic score\, tel
 ling the timeless story of Clara and her journey through the Land of Sweet
 s.\n\nThis year’s event takes place on **December 5th and 6th 2026\, at 
 1:00 PM and 5PM.** The performance will be held at Novato High School –
  Center for the Arts\, located at **625 Arthur Street\, Novato\, CA 94947*
 *.\n\nDon’t miss your chance to experience the **2026 Marin Ballet Nutcr
 acker** in person! We can’t wait to share this special event with you.\n
 \nTickets: Child Ticket up to age 18 or Seniors 65+: $34.59 Adult Tickets 
 Age 19+: $60.84
LOCATION:Center for the Arts - Novato
