DESCRIPTION:Holiday Winemaker Dinner Wine Club Exclusive 5:30-10 p.m. - 21
  & Older Only - No Children or Pets Allowed Join Second-Generation Winery 
 Owners Kim and Don Wallace\, and Winemakers Tim Bell and Brian Pruett for 
