  season with the Dry Creek Vineyard family. Make it a weekend by joining o
 ur optional outing on Friday\, Dec. 4 for the annual tree-lighting ceremon
 y on the plaza in downtown Healdsburg! This event is exclusive to Dry Cree
 k Vineyard wine club members. Not a member? Explore our  membership option
 s .   Tickets on Sale 8/6/26
LOCATION:Dry Creek Vineyard
