DESCRIPTION:Phil Johnson has an action packed show filled with his two lov
 es\, comedy and music. It’s a show filled with sharp unexpected turns\, 
 sneak attack jokes\, and hilarious songs that doesn’t shy away from cont
 roversial territory… race\, sex\, religion\, and doughnuts – so many d
 oughnuts – all delivered from the viewpoint of a guy who happily grew up
  in the deeply multi-everything community of the San Francisco Bay Area.\n
 \nPhil has been seen and heard at the Sundance Film Festival\, Edinburgh F
 ringe Festival\, on Sirius/XM\, Bob and Tom radio\, and Amazon Prime. He
 ’s also released multiple comedy specials and albums filled with his col
 orful\, tightly-written comedy.
LOCATION:Deerfield Ranch Winery
