BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/fortner-clayton-hamilton-trio/", "Creative Sonoma": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/fortner-clayton-hamilton-trio/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/fortner-clayton-hamilton-trio/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Fortner-Clayton-Hamilton Trio
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T190000
UID:260819n85w9r7LeEWFBwa96MaDpA
DESCRIPTION:Together they create a trio steeped in swing\, spontaneity\, a
 nd deep musical conversation. Their performances celebrate the timeless la
 nguage of the jazz trio while showcasing the individuality and brilliance 
 of three extraordinary artists. The trio will draw in part froma program t
 hey performed together in Europe last summerthat celebrated the legacy of 
 Oscar Peterson. In addition tomusic honoring Peterson's iconic trio tradit
 ion\, the concert will also feature original compositions by each artist\,
  showcasing the distinct voices of three of today's leading jazz musicians
  in an intimate and dynamic setting that bridges reverence for the past wi
 th the creative voices of today's leading improvisers. Sullivan Fortner wo
 n the Grammy Award for Best Jazz Instrumental Albumfor his album Southern 
 Nights at the 68th Annual Grammy Awards on February 1\, 2026. This marks h
 is third career Grammy win. John Clayton\, a Grammy Award-winning bassist\
 , composer\, and arranger\, has performed and recorded with artists rangin
 g from Diana Krall and Paul McCartney to Yo-Yo Ma. A former principal bass
 ist of the Amsterdam Philharmonic Orchestra\, he and Jeff Hamilton later c
 o-founded the renowned Clayton-Hamilton Jazz Orchestra\, one of the premie
 r big bands in jazz today. Jeff Hamilton\, a respected drummers in jazz\, 
 is known for his impeccable swing\, taste\, and musicality. Throughout his
  career he has performed with legends including Ray Brown\, Oscar Peterson
 \, and Monty Alexander\, and remains a driving force behind the Clayton-Ha
 milton Jazz Orchestra as well as his own acclaimed trio.
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/fortner-clayton-hamilton-trio/
X-SOURCE:Creative Sonoma, North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
