SUMMARY:Aprés Ski Holiday Crawl
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T160000
UID:260506cA79pRGqe0md6uwCW18NQQ
DESCRIPTION:APRÉS SKI HOLIDAY CRAWL \\(WINTER PICK-UP PARTY\\) \n\nJoin u
 s for a cozy two-winery holiday crawl across Gundlach Bundschu and Abbot
 ’s Passage\, where friends\, family\, and neighbors come together to sip
 \, shop\, and share in the spirit of the holidays and our club community. 
 \n\nWe’ll be pouring a few special bottles pulled from the family cellar
 \, enjoying festive snacks\, and visiting with members of the Bundschu fam
 ily throughout the day. You’ll also find exclusive opportunities to stoc
 k up for the holidays\, with limited offers and cheerful surprises you won
 ’t want to miss. And who knows — there might even be a few reindeer ga
 mes along the way. \n\nSo bundle up\, bring your favorite people\, and com
 e raise a glass to a little Bundschu cheer. \n\nDATE: Sunday December 6th 
 \n\nTIME: Noon-4 \n\nLOCATION: Gundlach Bundschu Winery \\+ Abbot’s Pass
 age Winery & Mercantile. This is a “CRAWL” so stop by one\, or both wi
 neries and maybe even somewhere in between! \n\nTICKETS AVAILABLE OCT 1: C
 lub members receive two \\(2\\) free tickets per membership. Additional ti
 ckets are $45pp. Guests under 21 are free to attend.
LOCATION:Gundlach Bundschu Winery
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/apres-ski-holiday-crawl/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
