DESCRIPTION:Gary Farrell Winery welcomes guests to its second annual  Holi
 day Sip & Shop \, a festive shopping experience featuring seasonal wines a
 nd a curated selection of local artisan goods. Guests can stroll through t
 he beautifully decorated winery with friends while discovering unique gift
 s and holiday treasures. Admission includes a walk-around tasting of holid
 ay-ready wines\, valet parking\, and a cookbook signing with the author an
 d winemaker. Guests will also have access to the Holiday Sip & Shop market
 place\, offering a variety of gifts for the season. Carpooling is highly e
 ncouraged\, and the event is open to guests ages 21 and older.
