SUMMARY:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T143000
UID:261023pviMyZwiGU-rJznwSwcwwg
DESCRIPTION:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’: a highly origin
 al\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acrobatics and at
 hletically stunning skill.\n\nSonoma\, CA— November 27 - Dec 27 – This
  2026 winter season\, New Moon Circus invites audiences to ‘La Lune Bril
 le’ — memorable family fun and stunning artistry under the intimate an
 d charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ big top.\n\nMeet the Winter moon
  and her frenemy\, the Sun.  When the moon is pushed from the sky\, she m
 ust find a way home to the stars. Come along the journey as she encounters
  mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way.\n\nA child pleasing 
 origin myth told through impressive aerialists\, jugglers\, acrobats\, and
  clever comedy\, this show blends classic storybook atmosphere with celest
 ial magic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages.\n\n
 Spectators for all showings are invited to the European style circus tent 
 to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before each show. Cornerstone Son
 oma will provide light concession and libations for purchase. \n\nThe eve
 nt will include a 15 minute intermission during the 1 and a half hour show
 .\n\nLimited free parking is available at the location at Cornerstone Sono
 ma.\n\nTickets for La Lune Brille are now available for purchase online at
  thenewmooncircus.com.\n\nIndividual ticket prices start at $40. Front row
  \\(VIP\\)\, options start at $65. Find showtimes and more details at then
 ewmooncircus.com. Early booking is encouraged for this highly anticipated 
 event.
LOCATION:CORNERSTONE SONOMA - Under the Big Top Tent
URL:https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
