X-SOURCE-ID:tockify_rileystreet.art.com
X-SOURCE:Riley Street Art Supply
UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/588/29943240/0/0
DTSTART:20261206T220000Z
DTEND:20261207T000000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/588/1796594400000
SUMMARY: "Ninety Minute Live Painting" Demonstration & Book Signing
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Craig Nelson\n\nDate: Sunday\, December 6th\n\nTim
 e: 2PM-4PM\n\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n\nFree!\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin us fo
 r an inspiring and educational live painting demonstration with renowned 
 artist Craig Nelson. During this demonstration\, Craig will showcase oil 
 painting techniques that allow him to create beautiful and dynamic painti
 ngs in 90 minutes.\n\nAfter the demonstration\, Craig will be available t
 o answer questions and sign copies of his new book\, Ninety Minute Live P
 aintings.\n\nNinety Minute Live Paintings collects 206 paintings made dur
 ing live 90-minute virtual sessions\, held weekly over four years startin
 g in March 2020. What began as a way to bring joy to an uncertain time be
 came a ritual Craig has continued ever since. The book is as much a docum
 ent of that period as it is a collection of the work itself.\n\nCraig Nel
 son began his career as an illustrator in 1970\, working with clients lik
 e Toyota\, the U.S. Air Force\, and UCLA\, and creating portraits and alb
 um covers for figures including Neil Simon\, Sammy Davis Jr.\, and Natali
 e Cole. For the past 35 years\, his focus has been Fine Art — rich\, vibr
 ant oils spanning portraits\, landscapes\, and urban scenes — earning 40+
  solo exhibitions\, 200+ awards\, and national medals. He has taught at t
 he university level since 1974 and currently serves as Executive Director
  of Fine Art Painting at Academy of Art University. His sought-after summ
 er plein air workshops have taken students throughout Europe\, with past 
 adventures in Italy\, Sicily\, Holland\, France\, Austria\, Amalfi\, Isch
 ia\, and a new journey planned for August 2027 in Cotswolds and Cornwall.
 \n\nRSVP to reserve your spot!
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Art-Demo,Free-Demo,Painting
