DESCRIPTION:**Date:** Friday\, December 11\, 2026\n\n**Time:** Doors 6:3
 0 PM\, Show 7:30 PM\n\n**Tickets:** Free\n\n**Food Vendor:** Smash'd Burg
 er Bar\n\n**21+ Only**\n\n**Location:** Coyote Sonoma - 44F Mill Street\, 
 Healdsburg CA\, 95448\n\nCarlos Herrera features Latin Music encompassing 
 diverse styles ranging from its colonial roots to popular influences\, wit
 h emphasis on music from Latin America. Noted for his guitar music and voc
 als but\, more for his improvisations and his uncanny ability to extempori
 ze. Herrera hales from Costa Rica where he began his music career at a ver
 y early age. After many years playing around Latin America with his band h
 e moved to The United States where he now resides in Sonoma Valley.
