 atre!\n\nTwo iconic catalogs. One night of classic rock favorites.\n\nJour
 ney Revisited brings the music of Journey to the stage\, joined by Foreign
 er Legacy performing the hits of Foreigner. Come sing along to the songs t
 hat defined a generation inside Petaluma’s historic Mystic Theatre.\n\nF
 riday\, December 11\, 2026\n\nMystic Theatre\n\n23 Petaluma Blvd. N\, Peta
 luma\, CA 94952\n\nDoors open at 6:30 PM\n\nShow starts at 7:30 PM
