 ncerts each year to five exciting interactive performances designed to i
 nspire curiosity\, creativity\, and a love of jazz in audiences of all age
 s.\n\nBest of all\, every Family Matinee concert is completely FREE\, mak
 ing it easy for children\, parents\, grandparents\, and music lovers of al
 l ages to experience world-class jazz together.\n\nPlease help us spread t
 he word! Because these concerts are offered free of charge\, we're relyi
