DESCRIPTION:**🎄 Enjoy a magical\, casual holiday celebration with fami
 ly and friends at Cornerstone Sonoma’s Jolly Jamboree. 🎄**\n\n**Join
  us for a festive celebration filled with holiday cheer\, seasonal shoppin
 g\, delicious food\, and joyful moments with family and friends.**\n\n**St
 roll through the beautiful grounds of Cornerstone Sonoma\, discover unique
  gifts from local artisans and vendors\, enjoy festive bites and beverages
 \, and soak in the magic of the holiday season.**\n\n**Whether you’re se
 arching for the perfect holiday gift\, planning a festive outing with frie
 nds\, or creating special memories with your little ones\, Jolly Jamboree 
 is the perfect place to celebrate!**\n\n**🎁 Highlights**\n\n**Family &
  Pet Friendly** – All ages welcome.\n\n**Live Music & Dancing** – Sq
 uare dancing\, Bluegrass band\, Line dancing\n\n**Holiday Shopping** – 
 Discover one-of-a-kind gifts\, handcrafted treasures\, and seasonal favori
 tes from local vendors.\n\n**Sip & Savor** – Enjoy delicious seasonal b
 ites\, wine\, and festive refreshments available for purchase.\n\n**Holida
 y Memories** – Gather your loved ones for a cheerful day filled with la
 ughter\, shopping\, and celebration. Enjoy pony rides and photos with Sant
 a.\n\n**Support Local** – Shop small and celebrate the talented makers\
 , artisans\, and businesses in our community.
LOCATION:Cornerstone Sonoma
URL:https://cornerstonesonoma.com/event/jolly-jamboree/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
