DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T160000
UID:261112-nVfutSPAkKQXoixqBJWew
DESCRIPTION:The Merriam Vineyards Winter Market brings holiday cheer to th
 e winery with an afternoon of seasonal shopping\, local vendors\, and wine
  by the glass. Visitors can browse unique gifts from local makers\, includ
 ing handmade Christmas ornaments\, candles\, artisanal honey\, skincare pr
 oducts\, terrariums\, and more. Pizzasanto will also serve fried chicken s
 liders for guests to enjoy while shopping. Featured vendors include Tender
  Loving Collectables\, Christensen Tallow Co.\, Heka Honey\, Menagerie Mel
 ting\, Slabathor\, and Green Glass Gardens\, with additional vendors to be
  announced. The family-friendly event welcomes children and dogs.
LOCATION:Merriam Vineyards
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/merriam-vineyards-winter-market/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
