SUMMARY:Rotary Club of Healdsburg - 47th Annual Community Gala & Crab Feas
 t
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T223000
UID:260925SdGBXBR8C0mxR-m--8kzkg
DESCRIPTION:47th Annual Community Gala & Crab Feast\n\nThe Rotary Club of 
 Healdsburg hosts its 47th Annual Community Gala & Crab Feast on Saturday\,
  December 12\, at 5:30 PM at Villa Chanticleer. This year's theme\, "Creat
 ing Lasting Impact\," celebrates the event's role in funding scholarships 
 for Healdsburg and Geyserville students\, community grants\, and environme
 ntal and cultural programs throughout the region. The evening includes an 
 all-you-can-eat Dungeness crab dinner\, local wine\, and live and silent a
 uctions. Tickets go on sale October 1 at healdsburgrotary.org. Sponsorship
  and auction donation opportunities are also available.
LOCATION:Villa Chanticleer
URL:https://healdsburgrotary.ejoinme.org/Tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
