DESCRIPTION:with James Baraz\, MA\, Tara Brach\, PhD and Jill White Lindsa
 y\n\nJoin us for a day of meditation and inquiry devoted to loosening the 
 habits that separate us from our inner life and from each other. As our he
 arts open\, we may rediscover our capacity for joy\, deepen our sense of k
 inship with all beings\, and engage more actively in caring for our world.
 \n\nJill White Lindsay will be guiding us in simple stretches and movement
  to ground us in our bodies as we go through the day.
