BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/swedish-lucia-fika"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Annual Lucia Jul Fika with Linnea Lodge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T160000
UID:261106Cer0Hz9zPEOUPWtRMTT6eQ
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Scandinavian holiday traditions with Linnea Lod
 ge!\n\nLinnea Lodge #504 invites Members\, families\, friends\, and those 
 interested in Scandinavian holiday traditions to come participate in our a
 nnual **Lucia Jul Fika.**\n\nA Swedish "fika" is a break in the day to en
 joy coffee and a treat. We're taking fika and adding our annual Santa Luci
 a pageant and other Jul traditions for a day of cultural fellowship. Enjoy
  live music\, dancing around the tree\, a gift basket drawing\, and a spec
 ial visit from Jultomten (Santa!) to complete the festivities.\\*\\*\n\nCo
 ffee\, tea\, and soft drinks will be served\, along with sandwiches\, chee
 se and crackerbread\, fruit\, cookies\, and traditional Swedish lussekatte
 r (saffron buns).\n\n**What to bring:**\n\n\\- Members: Please bring 1 sma
 ll Poinsettia for tables and a dozen cookies or a baked treat for our Fika
 \n\n\\- \\*\\*For everyone bringing children\, please bring a small wrappe
 d gift for each child in your party with their **name printed clearly on 
 the package.** *(Drop off packages discretely at check in.)*\n\nChildren 
 participating in the pageant are asked to arrive at 1:30 PM for practice. 
 Participating boys should wear black pants and a white shirt. Gowns provid
 ed.\n\n***Seating is limited. Please RSVP by December 2nd.***
LOCATION:Petaluma Veterans Memorial Building 
URL:https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/swedish-lucia-fika
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
