BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://spreckelsonline.com/show/2026-27-season/rooted/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Rooted
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T163000
UID:261106vfMY8UUDvkKAFABQ-Nd4mg
DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, Spreckels Theatre Company offers a heart
 warming alternative to traditional seasonal fare with *Rooted*\, a story a
 bout the messy\, fierce love that keeps us grounded. An intelligent\, gent
 le comedy by Deborah Zoe Laufer\, *Rooted* plays Nov. 27 – Dec.13!\n\nEm
 ery is perfectly content living in her beloved treehouse\, completely isol
 ated from the world\, communing with her plants. Meanwhile\, down on the g
 round\, her sister Hazel is thoroughly miserable\, slaving away at a dead-
 end diner job just to survive and financially support Emery’s eccentric 
 lifestyle. Looking on from the sidelines\, Luanne is yearning for somethin
 g\, anything to bring true meaning into her life.\n\n﻿The sisters' fragi
 le ecosystem is completely upended when Emery’s YouTube videos documenti
 ng her plant experiments unexpectedly go viral. Almost overnight\, her dig
 ital musings accidentally incite a full-blown CULT(!). As throngs of devot
 ed truth-seekers congregate below the treehouse\, the lives of all three w
 omen are plunged into chaos\, compelling each woman to choose their own pa
 th and find their bliss.\n\n*Pick-Your-Price Night: purchase sliding scale
  tickets starting at $10 each for the opening Friday night\, Nov. 27th.*
LOCATION:Spreckels Center for the Performing Arts - Bette Condiotti Experi
 mental Theatre
URL:https://spreckelsonline.com/show/2026-27-season/rooted/ 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.facebook.com/events/1599145155293030/1599145185293027/?active_tab=about"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Meet Me in St. Louis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T163000
UID:261112ykDv7utBmU6qycvtlef4mw
DESCRIPTION:Meet Me in St. Louis is a heartwarming\, nostalgic musical tha
 t brings the charm and excitement of turn-of-the-century America to life. 
 Set in 1904 on the eve of the St. Louis World’s Fair\, the story follows
  the Smith family through a year of romance\, humor\, and unexpected chang
 e. At its center is the spirited and lovestruck Esther Smith\, whose bloss
 oming romance unfolds alongside her sisters’ own adventures and the fami
 ly’s hopes for the future. Featuring beloved songs like “The Trolley S
 ong\,” “Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\,” and “The Boy Nex
 t Door\,” this classic musical overflows with warmth\, wit\, and unforge
 ttable melodies. Rich with period detail\, lively ensemble numbers\, and t
 ender family moments\, Meet Me in St. Louis celebrates community\, resilie
 nce\, and the enduring power of home. Audiences will be swept up in its co
 lorful seasonal settings—from summer dances to a magical Christmas Eve
 —culminating in the dazzling anticipation of the World’s Fair. Perfect
  for theatregoers of all ages\, this timeless musical offers romance\, lau
 ghter\, and a joyful reminder that even in times of change\, love and fami
 ly light the way forward. MEET ME IN ST. LOUIS is presented by arrangement
  with Concord Theatricals on behalf of Tams-Witmark LLC. concordtheatrical
 s.com
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1599145155293030/1599145185293027/?act
 ive_tab=about
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
