DESCRIPTION:Experience a higher class of cannabis at The Lounge at Mercy w
 ith Elevated Sessions\, an intimate\, sommelier-led tasting featuring prem
 ium Wood Wide indoor flower curated for true connoisseurs. During this 45-
 60 minute session\, your cannabis sommelier will guide you through five ex
 ceptional cultivars\, highlighting their aromas\, flavors\, terpene profil
 es\, and effects. Guests will also enjoy curated snacks\, palate cleansers
 \, and drinks from the natural soda bar\, making this a full sensory exper
 ience. Guests can meet the growers\, track their favorites in a tasting pa
 ssport\, and access exclusive perks including limited drops and 50% off pr
 emium flower \\(B1G1\\). Each session is limited to 16 guests\, with three
  available times: 4:20 PM\, 6 PM\, and 8 PM. Tickets include 5 curated tas
 tings\, a goodie bag\, tasting passport\, snacks\, and natural soda. Guest
 s must be 21\\+.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
