SUMMARY:FLEETWOOD MACRAMÉ WEEKEND
DESCRIPTION:Dinner Show with FLEETWOOD MACRAMÉ – Fleetwood Mac Tribute Band\nOne of the Bay Area’s most exciting tribute bands. What began as a simple exercise in fun has turned into an awe inspiring live experience complete with show stopping renditions of Fleetwood Mac’s greatest hits. Audience participation is encouraged\, and Bay Area crowds are coming in droves to sing along with Fleetwood Macramé. What’s more\, they sound so much like Fleetwood Mac\, if you closed your eyes\, you would think it was the real thing. Only it’s better\, because you are in the front row!
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/fleetwood-macrame-weekend-2/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fleetwood-Macrame.png
