UID:10000462-1799539200-1799625599@ranchonicasio.com
SUMMARY:MCQ'S BIRTHDAY BASH 2!
DESCRIPTION:MCQ’S BIRTHDAY BASH 2!\nFeaturing Michael McQuilkin\, Rebecca Chourre\, Kevin Frazier\, Howie Cort\, John Cunningham\, David Russ\, and Alexander McQuilkin\nCome celebrate the McQuilkin family birthdays at Marin’s legendary Rancho Nicasio nightclub on Sunday\, Jan 10th. Alexander turns 36 on the 17th and his Mom\, Grandpa Wally\, and Cousin Nolan all have their birthdays the same week. This special show will benefit the San Geronimo Valley Community Center’s Arts and Events programs which features Michael McQuilkin’s annual Family Music Hour show. Enjoy great music\, food\, and dancing to the sounds of HOWIE’S PERSUASION. Come early to reserve tables for this 5pm show – birthday cake included!
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/mcqs-birthday-bash-2/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/McQBand-Rancho-resized.jpg
END:VEVENT
