 e\, texture\, and movement.\n\nThere is no formal lesson\; the sessions r
 un for 3 hours and open to all regardless of experience. First Come First
  Served.\n\nLong pose\, every last Thursday of the month.\n\nDoors open a
 t 6:45pm\, front door entry.\n\nAll mediums are welcome except oil paint 
 (water soluble oil paint is okay).
