SUMMARY:Bring your own Telescope class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270115T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270115T200000
DTSTAMP:20261114T061708Z
UID:2fkjsttl4pfmukvivnd045do0n@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270115T170000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260821T005038Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u><p>Do you have a telescope at home that you just don’
 t use because you’re not sure how it works? Or\, are you looking to purc
 hase or upgrade a telescope but don’t know where to start? Then this cla
 ss is for you! You will work on-one-one with our knowledgeable docents who
  will guide you in collimating and operating your telescope\, and the basi
 cs of telescope operations. Please email Stephanie at <a href="mailto:sd@r
 fo.org" target="_blank">sd@rfo.org</a> to inform her what type of scope yo
 u are bringing prior to the event so we can be best prepared to help you. 
  </p><p>You MUST have a ticket to attend this event\; tickets will not be
  sold at the door. Purchase tickets at: <a href="http://rfo.simpletix.com"
