SUMMARY:Meeting Hall One Year Anniversary
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Intergroup Fellowship – Meeting Hall 1 Year Anniversary\nJoin us in celebrating the one-year anniversary of the Sonoma County Intergroup Fellowship Meeting Hall! This special occasion coincides with the “New Beginnings” Seminar & Potluck BBQ\, bringing our fellowship together for an afternoon of celebration\, food\, and community. \n\nWhen: Saturday\, January 16\, 2027\, 1:00–4:00 PM\nWhere: 750 Mendocino Avenue\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nZoom: 860 4370 3384 | Passcode: 62\n\nAll are welcome! Come celebrate this milestone with us and enjoy an afternoon of fellowship.
