 ealth concerns about a new resort\, certain to bring an influx of people\,
  publicity\, and money to his beloved town. Inspired by Henrik Iben’s cl
 assic\, An Enemy of the People\, the play takes a hard look at the profits
  and perils of over-tourism. A Raven premiere from our new works program\,
