X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Sonoma County Womens Wine Club": "https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events/317291545/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_sonoma_county_womens_wine_club
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_317291545@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061705Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270128T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270128T190000
SUMMARY:THIRSTY THURSDAY New Member Social for Sonoma County Women's Wine 
 Club
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nThis is our regular c
 lub meeting\, held on the last Thursday of every month except for holidays
  and we are super excited! Come join us at 4th Street Cellars in downtown 
 Santa Rosa. They have generously offered to host our monthly THIRSTY THURS
 DAY social for us.\n\nIf you are new to the area\, or just looking to get 
 out of the house and make new friends\, this is the place for you. Welcomi
 ng to ALL new and (ahem\, old) members.\n\nWine is purchased by the glass 
 for a set fee of $13/$14 per glass with the variety of white\, rosé\, and
  red wines offered through 4th Street Cellars which includes tip. Fees are
  collected at the venue by Co-organizer Daima Phipps via cash\, Venmo\, or
  Paypal. You are welcome to purchase wine separately if you choose. Starti
 ng in 2026\, we ask that every attending member pay a $2 "slush" fund fee 
 per event so that we can build up our funds for club-related expenses\, wh
 ich can be paid by Venmo or cash.\n\nThere is no food offered\, but you ar
 e welcome to bring an appetizer or snack to share with the group\, and man
 y ladies do. We will have time to socialize while tasting in the room upst
 airs to the left or the outside patio if the weather is nice.\n\nThe space
  has a 25 person attendee limit\, but the list is open to 40 to eliminate 
 a waitlist\, and guests are welcome! Please RSVP below only if you are abl
 e to make it\, we have an attendance policy: if you No-Show to three event
 s\, you may not attend events for the next three months. Please put this e
 vent in your calendar so you don't miss out or get dinged. A No-Show is wh
 en you are on the 'Going' list\, but do not show up.\n\nSee you there\, re
 ady to kickoff!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /317291545/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261105T000652Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T000652Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
