 g. Docents set up additional telescopes in front of the building. Friendly
  and knowledgeable docents are available to answer your questions. $18.00 
 per adult\; $15.00 for seniors 62+\, $12 for students\; $7 youth 6 to 12\;
  5 and under FREE. (Plus State Park Parking Fee $10.00 per vehicle.) <br>
