DESCRIPTION:MARS… the red planet. This rocky planet\, fourth from the Su
 n\, could harbor life and is the focus of much science and intrigue. Come 
 learn what makes this planet so interesting\,  discover the night sky\, a
 nd view Mars when it will be at its very best this season!\n\nPlease visit
  <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.rfo.simpletix.com&amp\;s
 a=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1788546817322053&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0Kq2JEEa
 kvMhrYv2gQLRmO" target="_blank">www.rfo.simpletix.com</a> for important i
 nformation and to buy tickets. Seating is limited and you MUST have a tick
 et to attend this event\; tickets will not be sold at the door.\n\nCost is
  $50 per adult\, $40 for members\, and $45 for seniors or under 18 student
 s and includes the State Park parking fee.
