 en\nJuly 14: Digestive Health Essentials: Beyond Probiotics\nAug 11: Brain
  Power: Food\, Mood & Memory\nSept 8: Hormone Harmony: Understanding Your 
 Changing Body\nOct 13: The Secrets to Better Sleep: Restore Your Natural R
 hythms\nNov 10: Love Your Heart: Beyond Cholesterol\nDec 8: Seasonal Wisdo
 m for Winter Wellness
