 k god Dionysus—and she's returned to the modern world to gather mortal f
 ollowers and restore the Earth to its natural state. Where better to begin
  than with four housewives in a suburban New Jersey cul-de-sac? In this Ob
 ie-winning comedy with a twist\, Pulitzer Prize finalist Madeleine George 
 pens a hilarious evisceration of the blind eye we all turn to climate chan
 ge
