SUMMARY: How to Draw People\, Places and Things
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Ann Marie Torrez\nOn-going\, Thursdays\n2:00PM-4:
 00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$35.00 Per Class\n\nJoin Ann Torrez and
  learn a few different ways to achieve instant gratification quickly in y
 our drawings and get to the fun part of creating!\n\nAnn will introduce y
